WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.640
 - Do you have more bugs when you start a project

00:00:03.640 --> 00:00:08.640
 from scratch with AI than having a code base?

00:00:08.800 --> 00:00:11.400
 You add a AI layer on top of it?

00:00:11.400 --> 00:00:14.280
 - You need to have AI do an infantilization

00:00:14.280 --> 00:00:16.520
 of all the rules to go to framework,

00:00:16.520 --> 00:00:17.800
 then you don't get any bugs.

00:00:17.800 --> 00:00:21.480
 But if you say, hey, this is the system, go create this,

00:00:21.480 --> 00:00:24.200
 you're getting a lot of bugs because it just focuses

00:00:24.200 --> 00:00:27.240
 on that step and doesn't read everything else in the frame.

